                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "src": "v1/lessons/media/ssgap-1-ssg-peritoneal-surface-malignancy.webp",
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "alt": "Opened abdomen at cytoreduction with white mesothelioma plaques over peritoneum, omentum and bowel, plus an epithelioid histology inset.",
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "caption": "Confluent white plaques of diffuse malignant peritoneal mesothelioma stud the parietal peritoneum, omentum and small bowel serosa, with an inset of epithelioid cells. Illustration: StewardMD original.",
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "ar": 1.3393
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          }}, {"say": "Gastric peritoneal disease with positive cytology alone gets neoadjuvant FLOT with reassessment, and bulky PCI over twelve goes palliative without CRS. Positive washings without visible implants still count as metastatic. Restage after chemotherapy before any theatre talk.", "tx": "Gastric peritoneal disease with **positive cytology** alone gets neoadjuvant FLOT with reassessment in trials and selected cases, and bulky disease around PCI **12** or more is usually **palliative** without CRS outside trials. Cytology-positive lavage converts curative gastrectomy plans to systemic-first strategy, and conversion to negative cytology reopens the surgical question. Peritoneal recurrence after gastrectomy suits trial PIPAC or systemic therapy rather than repeat cytoreduction.", "vis": {"edges": [["cyto", "flot"], ["flot", "restage"]], "kind": "flow", "nodes": [{"id": "cyto", "label": "Positive cytology only"}, {"id": "flot", "label": "Neoadjuvant FLOT"}, {"id": "restage", "label": "Reassess for CRS"}]}}, {"say": "Ovarian peritoneal carcinomatosis gets interval CRS with HIPEC after neoadjuvant chemotherapy per OVHIPEC, with forty five point seven versus thirty three point nine month median survival with cisplatin HIPEC. Omental cake with implants over two centimetres marks stage three C disease. Complete interval surgery after three cycles gives non-inferior survival with lower morbidity than primary surgery in bulky cases.", "tx": "**Ovarian** peritoneal carcinomatosis gets **interval CRS** with HIPEC after neoadjuvant chemotherapy per **OVHIPEC**, with **45.7** versus 33.9 month median survival with cisplatin HIPEC, though later trials dispute the benefit. Omental cake with implants and R0 cytoreduction intent define the operation, and HIPEC at interval surgery adds the proven months. Bulky stage IIIC to IV disease gains from chemotherapy-first sequencing with lower morbidity.", "vis": {"alt": "Epithelial ovarian carcinoma with omental cake, peritoneal implants, FIGO stages and R0 cytoreduction target.", "caption": "Ovarian carcinomatosis with cytoreduction target. Image: StewardMD.", "kind": "image", "src": "v1/kb/media/ovarian-cancer-staging-and-cytoreduction-fig1.webp"}}, {"say": "Pressurised intraperitoneal aerosol chemotherapy delivers oxaliplatin laparoscopically for unresectable disease. Repeat every six weeks with PCI reassessment, since some patients convert to resectable. PIPAC remains a palliative or trial option between systemic therapy and surgery.", "tx": "**PIPAC** delivers **aerosol chemotherapy** laparoscopically for unresectable disease, repeated every **6** weeks with PCI reassessment, with the drug matched to the primary tumour. Pressurised mist distributes more evenly than liquid dwell, with about a tenth of the systemic dose and low systemic exposure. Objective response with PCI fall rarely reopens CRS discussion in trials, while progression confirms palliative systemic therapy as the ceiling.", "vis": {"cols": ["Cycle", "What happens", "Decision point"], "kind": "table", "rows": [["Every 6 weeks", "Oxaliplatin aerosol", "PCI reassessed"], ["Response", "PCI falls", "Consider CRS"], ["Progression", "PCI rises", "Stay palliative"]]} }], "subject": "ss-surgical-gastroenterology", "title": "Peritoneal malignancy: PCI, cytoreduction, HIPEC and PIPAC", "v": 1}
